<title>UK: New York adds $50 million to August 2002 FRN.</title>
<headline>New York adds $50 million to August 2002 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible floating-rate issue has been increased to $350 million from $300 million, lead manager Goldman Sachs said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF NEW YORK</p>
<p> AMT   *$50 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE  **24.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.91     FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    99.91</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR $300 MLN ON 15.JAN.97</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 86 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST. FIRST COUPON MAY 1.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>		REDEMPTION SCHEDULE AND AMORTITISATION AS PER THE</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL ISSUE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
